msgid "Типы для расширений"
msgstr "Extension types"

msgid ""
"Эти типы полезны для аннотации собственных фабрик и настроек. Для обычной модели достаточно "
"``ProtoModel``, ``field`` и аннотаций из ``bytespec.types``. Resolver, его встроенные фабрики и "
"собранные metadata полей не являются необходимыми точками подключения пользовательского кода."
msgstr ""
"These types are useful for annotating custom factories and settings. Ordinary models only need "
"``ProtoModel``, ``field``, and annotations from ``bytespec.types``. The resolver, its built-in "
"factories, and the collected field metadata are not required integration points for user code."

msgid "Параметры"
msgstr "Parameters"

msgid ""
"Настройки поля, которые получает фабрика codec: индекс, flag, default, factory, префикс, "
"кодировка и явный codec. В моделях создавайте их через ``field()``, а не через конструктор "
"``FieldInfo``."
msgstr ""
"The field settings received by a codec factory: index, flag, default, factory, prefix, encoding, "
"and explicit codec. In models, create them using ``field()``, rather than the ``FieldInfo`` "
"constructor."

msgid ""
"Поддержаны числа ``1``, ``2``, ``4``, ``8`` и аннотация ``VarUInt``. ``VarInt`` не "
"поддерживается. ``None`` в field оставляет default codec. псевдоним для "
":py:obj:`~typing.Literal`\\ [1, 2, 4, 8] | :py:class:`~typing.Annotated`\\ [:py:class:`int`, "
":py:class:`~bytespec.types.spec.VarIntSpec`\\ (signed=\\ False)]"
msgstr ""
"The numbers ``1``, ``2``, ``4``, ``8``, and the ``VarUInt`` annotation are supported. ``VarInt`` "
"is not supported. ``None`` in field leaves the codec default unchanged. alias of "
":py:obj:`~typing.Literal`\\ [1, 2, 4, 8] | :py:class:`~typing.Annotated`\\ [:py:class:`int`, "
":py:class:`~bytespec.types.spec.VarIntSpec`\\ (signed=\\ False)]"

msgid ""
"Те же беззнаковые представления для Constructor, PayloadLength и Flags. Числа означают ширину"
" в байтах, VarUInt — переменное представление. псевдоним для :py:obj:`~typing.Literal`\\ [1, "
"2, 4, 8] | :py:class:`~typing.Annotated`\\ [:py:class:`int`, "
":py:class:`~bytespec.types.spec.VarIntSpec`\\ (signed=\\ False)]"
msgstr ""
"The same unsigned encodings for Constructor, PayloadLength, and Flags. Numbers specify the width "
"in bytes; VarUInt selects a variable-length representation. alias of :py:obj:`~typing.Literal`\\ "
"[1, 2, 4, 8] | :py:class:`~typing.Annotated`\\ [:py:class:`int`, "
":py:class:`~bytespec.types.spec.VarIntSpec`\\ (signed=\\ False)]"

msgid "Функция без аргументов либо служебный маркер отсутствия фабрики."
msgstr "A function with no arguments, or an internal sentinel indicating no factory."

msgid ""
"Тип callable из ``configure_codecs()``. В текущем пути выбора скалярного codec передаются только "
"``annotation`` и ``field_info``. Не требуйте третий аргумент: в протоколе он необязателен."
msgstr ""
"The callable type used in ``configure_codecs()``. The current scalar codec selection path passes "
"only ``annotation`` and ``field_info``. Do not require a third argument: it is optional in the "
"protocol."

msgid ""
"В сигнатуре фабрики может встречаться ``ResolveCallback`` — внутренний callback разрешения "
"аннотации. Для регистрации собственного скалярного типа он не нужен."
msgstr ""
"A factory signature may include ``ResolveCallback``, an internal callback for resolving an "
"annotation. It is not needed to register a custom scalar type."

msgid "Выбор codec"
msgstr "Codec selection"

msgid ""
"Сначала отделяется optional-часть аннотации. Далее выбирается явный ``field(codec=...)``, затем "
"зарегистрированная фабрика для аннотации, затем обрабатывается ``Annotated``. Если они не дали "
"результата, применяются правила для вложенных моделей, enum и списков."
msgstr ""
"The optional part of the annotation is separated first. Selection then checks for an explicit "
"``field(codec=...)``, followed by a registered factory for the annotation, then processes "
"``Annotated``. If none of these produces a result, the rules for nested models, enums, and lists "
"apply."

msgid ""
"Фабрика скалярного типа вызывается при создании класса с аннотацией и ``FieldInfo``. Она сама "
"учитывает ``prefix_length`` и ``encoding``, если они нужны её codec. Возвращённое "
"``configure_codecs()`` отображение дополняет унаследованные правила; совпадающий ключ заменяет "
"фабрику для этого типа. После сборки схемы экземпляры codecs используются при записи и чтении."
msgstr ""
"A scalar type factory is called at class creation with the annotation and ``FieldInfo``. It "
"handles ``prefix_length`` and ``encoding`` itself if its codec needs them. The mapping returned "
"by ``configure_codecs()`` extends inherited rules; a matching key replaces the factory for that "
"type. Once the schema has been built, the codec instances are used for writing and reading."

msgid "Field settings passed to a user-defined codec factory."
msgstr "Field settings passed to a user-defined codec factory."

msgid ""
"In models, create them via `field()`. The factory may read `prefix_length`, `encoding`, and other"
" settings to construct a codec."
msgstr ""
"In models, create them via `field()`. The factory may read `prefix_length`, `encoding`, and other"
" settings to construct a codec."

msgid "Explicit field position, or None for automatic selection."
msgstr "Explicit field position, or None for automatic selection."

msgid "Presence bit index for an optional field, or None."
msgstr "Presence bit index for an optional field, or None."

msgid "Default value or the MISSING sentinel."
msgstr "Default value or the MISSING sentinel."

msgid "Zero-argument factory or MISSING."
msgstr "Zero-argument factory or MISSING."

msgid "Length prefix size, or None to use the default."
msgstr "Length prefix size, or None to use the default."

msgid "Text encoding, UTF-8 by default."
msgstr "Text encoding, UTF-8 by default."

msgid "Explicitly assigned codec instance, or None."
msgstr "Explicitly assigned codec instance, or None."

msgid "Codec factory returned by rules configured via `configure_codecs()`."
msgstr "Codec factory returned by rules configured via `configure_codecs()`."

msgid ""
"When selecting a codec for a scalar field, it is called with two arguments: the annotation and "
"`FieldInfo`. It returns a ready-to-use codec instance. The third protocol argument is optional "
"and is not passed in this path."
msgstr ""
"When selecting a codec for a scalar field, it is called with two arguments: the annotation and "
"`FieldInfo`. It returns a ready-to-use codec instance. The third protocol argument is optional "
"and is not passed in this path."

